Word list (palavras.txt)

The file palavras.txt is an unmodified copy of the Portuguese word list of
BIP-39 (Mnemonic code for generating deterministic keys):

  Repository: https://github.com/bitcoin/bips
  File:       bip-0039/portuguese.txt
  Commit:     d353c54154bac64a88eb18cf2d47d15ead083de4 (2020-09-01)
  SHA-256:    2685e9c194c82ae67e10ba59d9ea5345a23dc093e92276fc5361f6667d79cd3f

BIP-39 falls under the MIT License: the same terms printed above apply to the
word list, with the copyright held by its authors, listed below.

BIP-39 authors: Marek Palatinus, Pavol Rusnak, Aaron Voisine and Sean Bowe.

Portuguese word list authors, as recorded in the commit that created the file:
sabotag3x, ninjastic, Breno Rodrigues Brito, bitmover, alegotardo, kuthullu
and Trimegistus.
